WEBVTT

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.610
Good morning, Ishinagare-san!

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.320
Good morning!

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.200
Morning!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.280
Good morning!

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.160
Ishinagare-san!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.580
Good morning!

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.270
Milky Holmes is still asleep...

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.550
They've been like this every day now...

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.810
Oh, we're late...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.690
Please wake up, Cordelia-san. It's afternoon already.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.190
Nero, Herc-san, Kamaboko.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.570
The alarm clock didn't ring, huh?

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.820
It's probably broken.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:02.290
It's nighttime...

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.250
Not the afternoon...

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.670
I guess we overslept a little.

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:10.000
Classes are over!

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.840
Wait!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.880
My neck hurts...

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.760
Maybe you slept weird.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.510
Oh, that constellation looks like Kamaboko!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.930
Where?

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.310
It looks yummy!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.780
We fell in the pond!

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.280
We can bathe in it!

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.070
That takes care of laundry too!

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:40.320
Two birds, one stone.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.620
I'll wash you!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.580
Take that!

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.540
Okay!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.630
Dawn is upon us!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.750
Let's start!

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:11.360
Paradise! Shambhala! Heaven!

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.230
The Fun Farm of Milky Holmes!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.190
Koboten, good morning!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.620
I got one!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.240
Oh yeah!

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.710
This is our wonderful flower garden!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.340
Is it ready yet!?

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.250
Weeding!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.960
Watering!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:37.920
Growing!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.720
Ooh, they're so cute!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.010
And delicious!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.050
Ahh, they grow so fast!

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:46.970
May these cucumbers and eggplants grow big.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.850
We can really stand on our own now, eh?

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.940
There's a chicken among the beautiful roses~

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:57.530
Don't grow something we can't eat!
Why don't you help us water the plants too?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.200
You can eat them if you just try~

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.530
I'll say it as many times as necessary!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:07.540
Remember this, along with my beauty, because it'll be on the exam!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.040
There are many different kinds of Toys!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.080
Yes, just like how several parts of my body are beautiful!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.420
Detectives are the ones who rightfully use them for our citizens, and myself!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.340
But only phantom thieves can use them beautifully!!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:24.220
Are you listening, Milky Holmes!?

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.890
They're not even coming to classes anymore.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.890
They've fallen into a really bad lifestyle.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.390
A negative spiral.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.690
An embarrassment to the rest of the world.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:41.490
Grandpa... What happened to my cap...

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.070
Their lifestyle is deteriorating...

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:54.080
Nijuuri-sensei, shouldn't education be about leading uselesslessless students to the right path?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.840
Nezu-san, isn't friendship about offering a helping hand to uselesslesslessless classmates?

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.720
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.800
Shape up!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.090
Right!

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:11.520
Henriette-sama is so gloomy lately...

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:15.810
Just looking at how corrupted Milky Holmes is would make anyone gloomy!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.810
In other words...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.820
Milky Holmes is the one at fault here.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.490
It's morning! It's morning!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:32.580
Heave-ho for my tomatoes!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.460
There.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.840
Herc, it's almost time for work.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.680
Eh? Work?

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.930
I went out of my way to sign you up for it.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.520
Do your best, okay?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.230
Here's the address.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.690
Sher, it's almost gathering time.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.900
Okay!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.900
I'll be back, my tomatoes!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.860
Later!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.620
<i>"Work" meant...</i>

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.700
<i>...being an art model?</i>

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.040
Your pose... should be like this!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.710
L-Like this?

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:20.210
Yes! It's coming to me now! In clouds of smoke!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.170
Clouds of smoke! Clouds of smoke!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:26.470
And then the smoke... explodes!!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.970
Now, draw! Draw, draw, draw 'till your hands bleed!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.970
My <i>pièce de résistance!</i> I call it, "Explosion"!!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.270
Gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.150
Please!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.730
Here's some bread crusts.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.230
Please!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.740
Here's some soy pulp.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.360
Please!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:49.490
Here's some lard. Buy some beef next time, okay?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.080
I can't!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.290
I've got lots! I've got lots! I've got lots! I've got lots!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.330
This voice is...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.710
Kokoro-chan!

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.920
What's a world fair!? I'll tell you!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.630
Soon, in this Detective Metropolis of Yokohama,

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:09.300
we are holding a good-for-nothing event called the
"Great Detective International Exposition"!!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.850
Kokoro, you're wonderful!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.770
Her costume is so cute!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.140
But you know...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.150
If we're going to do it, shouldn't it be about the police instead!?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.900
Am I right!?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:27.860
Okay, some news about this world fair! It's going to start in six months!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.910
Detective fair, huh?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.990
That's a detective metropolis for you.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:38.790
Even though we got our former jobs back,
we're handing out fliers for some world fair?

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.340
Genius 4's free time just goes to show how peaceful Yokohama is right now.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.260
Everyone, you don't have to help out at the world fair!

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:50.680
I mean, it would be nice if you could help...

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.720
Help us out, dammit!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.390
Okay, that's all for the Yokohama policewomen's presentation!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.310
Exit stage left, and we're done!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:07.230
Why does the beautiful genius girl, Kokoro, with an IQ of 1400, have to do this job!?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:11.450
G4 fair! No, it should only be a fair for me!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.910
Kokoro Pavilion!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.120
Ooh, that looks so good on you!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.620
Kokoro-chan!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.450
Don't call me that!!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:22.420
Kokoro! C'mon, let's go home together!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.130
S-She's here!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.250
Wait up, Kokoro!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.260
I wonder if she'll be able to run away...

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.130
I'll wager 3000 points that it's impossible.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.340
I'll bet all of my points on Harataira-san.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:38.310
Cordelia-san, Nero! Look how much I gathered!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.140
Awesome!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.890
Me too! Here's some freshly picked vegetables!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.120
Today was another fulfilling day.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.410
Living with Mother Earth is the best!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:05.630
We can eat the freshest vegetables.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.420
Herc, was the job fun?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.800
You can deposit your pay into this account.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.630
Is that yours?

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.890
I'll make it grow through foreign exchange!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.430
Ah, that cloud looks like Koboten!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:22.890
You're right!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.230
We fell in again!

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.320
Shampoo!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.780
Body soap!

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.910
Conditioner!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:52.210
Henriette-sama, a smile upon your face is as befitting as beauty is to myself.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.110
I have stolen it just for you...

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:58.510
Yokohama's secret treasure, the Yococcus.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.430
That worthless item won't satisfy me.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.480
Ah, w-well then, how about a rare collectible photo!?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.240
Henriette-sama.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.740
I've simmered this for three days and three nights straight...

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.410
My prided beef stew.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.120
It will make your mouth burst with pleas―

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.000
I've no appetite right now.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:38.340
I hate Milky Holmes right now!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.720
You can sandwich the bread crusts!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.220
Melt-in-your-mouth...

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.020
What are you doing!?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.150
What do you want to become?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.900
Rich!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.360
A-A singer...

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:03.240
Um, I want to be a beekeeper...

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.700
Aren't you forgetting something!?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.160
Something important!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.540
You have one too, Henriette-san!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.420
Here!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.630
First come first serve!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:24.260
My bread crusts!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:26.640
Henriette-san...

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:33.900
They're forgetting their detective selves every day, every second...

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.900
How far do they intend to fall!?

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:50.170
I thought something pretty would cheer Henriette-sama up...

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.750
High quality watch...

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.920
Simmering for three days and three nights...

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.090
It's Milky Holmes's fault!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:02.800
Yes! Grotesque Milky Holmes is driving beautiful Henriette-sama mad!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.010
I'll tear you to pieces with my nipples!!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.350
We move for Henriette-sama's sake...

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.270
The Phantom Thief Empire!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.370
Here's a sukiyaki of lard!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.370
Is it safe to give him that?

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.380
Eh? You're going to hatch an egg soon?

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.130
Nero, Koboten is a male...

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.850
Gosh, Nero! And I thought you said you can understand animals!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.850
No reaction!?

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.770
In that case...!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.810
You want more lard?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.570
I think he's having heartburn...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.280
Kamaboko's lard!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.410
He doesn't want any, sheesh...

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.410
Three second rule!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.040
That's for if it was on the floor!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.210
There's something tied to it...

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.220
Um...

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:27.180
"A ... of ... for Milky Holmes."

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.060
What?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:32.140
Are they really in the same school as me?

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.020
Here's another!

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:40.860
"A letter of challenge for Milky Holmes."

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.950
"O B S C E N E" ...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.580
What does that mean?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.170
Dunno...

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.660
Nero, do you know?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.210
Is it yummy?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.340
"(E)nmity burns within us as never before."

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.010
"(N)o longer can we stand it! (E)rgo, this is unforgivable!"

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.880
"(C)ome to your dear farm at midnight tonight."

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:10.560
"(S)hould you wish to protect your detective pride, heed our challenge!"

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.390
"(B)ail out, and you'll pay! (O)ver and out, P.T.E."

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.730
Phantom Thief Empire!?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.440
Pride?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.190
What should we do?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.780
Let's sleep on it!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.910
It's almost midnight.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.530
Come to me, Milky Holmes!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.410
C'mon, hurry up!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.720
They're not coming...

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:39.420
People who don't uphold appointments are the lowest of the low.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.550
Can I take my clothes off now?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.000
Sure, why not.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.550
Morning! Morning!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.140
Let's do our best at our farm again today!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.270
I wonder if my flowers have bloomed yet!?

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.230
Eggplants... Cucumbers...

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.690
Time to fish!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.160
W-What is this?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.240
No way...

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.410
This is too much...

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.780
My tomatoes...!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:17.290
How long are you gonna hold us up!?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.790
Don't blame me or my cucumber, dear veggies!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.670
If you want someone to blame, there's Milky Holmes!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.800
Cucumber? Cucumbah!!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.180
They're destroying my field!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.970
It's <i>our</i> field!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.830
My flower garden...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.850
So cruel...

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.690
So you're finally here.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.030
You're late!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.530
I made them much more delicious for you girls.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.200
How would you like a taste of my eggplants and cucumbers!?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.950
Hey, bring it on already!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.870
My fishing rod!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.130
Come on, Milky Holmes!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.090
My tomato!!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.670
Milky Holmes, move out!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.970
You girls... What the hell!?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.720
Weren't you gonna change to your detective uniforms!?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.520
De...

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.020
tec...

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:18.520
ti...

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.520
...ve?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.140
What the heck is that!?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.110
Stop it!!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:26.690
No!!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:29.190
I'm sorry! Please, spare us!!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.370
Eh? What? More, more!!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:41.580
<i>Vegetables. They are miraculous plants that grow in chosen fields.</i>

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:46.670
<i>Some bloom with flowers of purple,
while others bloom with flowers of yellow.</i>

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.800
<i>The Age of Farming.</i>

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.510
<i>Their names are the eggplant and the cucumber.</i>

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.300
Look. Those are detectives.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.570
Ah... Sensei...

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.400
It's Rat...

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.820
Rat...

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.240
Finish them!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.530
Don't!!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.450
We have 0 HP left!

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.290
Aren't you detectives!?

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.080
De...

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:23.920
Detect...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.330
...ives?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.960
Don't just stop there!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:32.010
If you want to defeat us as phantom thieves, then at least do it as detectives!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:37.470
If you can beautifully defeat us as detectives, then we wouldn't not mind not accepting it!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.930
Detectives?

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.390
That's right... We were...

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.850
Detectives!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:46.770
Yes, let's fight like detectives!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.570
Milky Holmes, present!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.530
Huh?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.570
One more time!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.110
Milky Holmes, present!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.240
No!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:03.790
Milky Holmes, present!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.670
They're so retarded...

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.790
Milky Holmes―

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.510
I finally got away!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.430
That's right, I can still do it!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.430
How you like them apples, Irene!?

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.060
Found you!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:34.070
They weakened as soon as they remembered their detective selves.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.700
How ugly.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.990
This is the end for them.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.740
For Arsène-sama's sake...

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.490
...we'll end it all here!

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:42.360
And now... This is goodbye!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.090
Man, there's been tons of explosions lately...

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.300
Oh, it's the Phantom Thief Empire and Milky Holmes.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.510
Kokoro, too.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.220
Unable to comprehend the situation.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:13.480
Milky Holmes has finally remembered what being a detective is, but...

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:17.200
They're the most uselesslessless of the uselesslesslessless.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.950
Some shock is necessary to wake them up.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.450
And that requires a good...!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.380
Sheesh, some little kid just had to butt in.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:36.010
Let us depart from this place at once. It is unbecoming of my beautiful self!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.010
No!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:40.430
We must stay in here.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.220
Why?

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.610
We'll repent on our actions until dawn!

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:46.600
He's so annoying...

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.440
Is this the mayor of Yokohama?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.900
I am Henriette Mystère. Excuse me for calling at this hour.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.790
Yes, it's about our talk the other day...

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.780
I've thought of something quite effective.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.210
Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.120
Let's rebuild our farm from the ground up!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.880
Eggplants... Cucumbers, please wait for us!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.840
I can make as many fishing rods as I need!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.760
Let's work hard!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.520
No way!!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.940
Our...

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.900
My...

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.820
...field!
